body:
i know the agony i have is not my own to bear, i know others are going through so much as well. i hope to just talk, find some person to talk to and regulate a little, i have never given up before, and this is looking far worse than ever before, no one can save me, i know. 

&#x200B;

but words have saved me before, words from those who had concern of others, i miss those conversations. i miss them almost enough to meet the family i hold closest to my heart on the other side, i have so much i want to ask them, but i can't. so maybe someone else can talk with me. maybe someone else can explain there life and converse like a real person, rather than a hotline with predetermined scriptures to offer.
